Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:10:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1334/3799] soh: rename func_80B93E5C -> ObjHsblock_Rise

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: accelerates the block up to home height, then snaps it there, re-enables culling and returns it to the idle state.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Hsblock/z_obj_hsblock.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Hsblock/z_obj_hsblock.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Hsblock/z_obj_hsblock.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Hsblock/z_obj_hsblock.c
index 7d1acc496..f3756b5c9 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Hsblock/z_obj_hsblock.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Hsblock/z_obj_hsblock.c
@@ -16,7 +16,8 @@ void ObjHsblock_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B93DF4: waits for the block's switch flag before starting the rise.
 void ObjHsblock_WaitForSwitch(ObjHsblock* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80B93DF4 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_80B93E5C(ObjHsblock* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B93E5C: accelerates the block up to home height, then snaps it there, re-enables culling and returns it to the idle state.
+void ObjHsblock_Rise(ObjHsblock* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80B93E5C [LLM:HIGH]
 
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B93D90: clears actionFunc so the block just sits there; the terminal state for every variant.
 void ObjHsblock_SetupIdle(ObjHsblock* this);  // was func_80B93D90 [LLM:HIGH]
@@ -129,10 +130,10 @@ void ObjHsblock_WaitForSwitch(ObjHsblock* this, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
 void ObjHsblock_SetupRise(ObjHsblock* this) {
-    ObjHsblock_SetupAction(this, func_80B93E5C);
+    ObjHsblock_SetupAction(this, ObjHsblock_Rise);  // was func_80B93E5C [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
-void func_80B93E5C(ObjHsblock* this, PlayState* play) {
+void ObjHsblock_Rise(ObjHsblock* this, PlayState* play) {
     Math_SmoothStepToF(&this->dyna.actor.velocity.y, 16.0f, 0.1f, 0.8f, 0.0f);
     if (fabsf(Math_SmoothStepToF(&this->dyna.actor.world.pos.y, this->dyna.actor.home.pos.y, 0.3f,
                                  this->dyna.actor.velocity.y, 0.3f)) < 0.001f) {
